## **Slide 3: System Architecture & Technology Stack**
### **Cloud-Native, Resilient & Scalable Full-Stack Architecture**

```mermaid
graph LR
    A[Google Form / Sheet] -->|Apps Script Webhook| B[Render Java Spring Boot Backend]
    B -->|CRUD & Persistence| C[(Google Cloud Firestore)]
    D[Vercel SPA Frontend] -->|Authenticated REST API| B
    D -->|Auth Tokens| E[Firebase Authentication]
```

- **Frontend**: Single Page Application (SPA), Vanilla JS, Modern CSS tokens, Vite Bundler, hosted on **Vercel**.
- **Backend**: Java 17, Spring Boot 3, Spring Security, Docker Container, hosted on **Render**.
- **Database & Auth**: Google Cloud Firestore (NoSQL Document Store), Firebase Auth (JWT Tokens).
- **Automation**: Google Apps Script event triggers on Google Spreadsheets.

